{"unit_id":"LobotomyCorporation__dsh-token-bar#card-zh","repo":"LobotomyCorporation/dsh-token-bar","commit":"2fbb659a9f833fd191ff7a71e0e4b9aab929e109","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-bar 是一个面向 DSH Web 的客户端界面插件，在每条助手回复的图标行内显示本轮 token 用量。它接入 conversation.chat.assistant-actions 插槽，并按消息 ID 从会话数据中找到对应已完成轮次的 token 统计。用量条以灰、黄、绿显示未缓存输入、缓存读取和输出，同时列出各部分占比；悬停可查看缓存命中率、精确 token 数和百分比。它适合希望快速比较不同回复缓存与输出占比的 DSH Web 用户。插件使用平台提供的 React，不需要额外 API 密钥或服务；需要 DSH Web 提供相应插槽及会话选择器。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:278-324","client.js:41-57","client.js:164-171"]}
{"unit_id":"LobotomyCorporation__dsh-token-bar#card-en","repo":"LobotomyCorporation/dsh-token-bar","commit":"2fbb659a9f833fd191ff7a71e0e4b9aab929e109","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-token-bar displays each completed DSH Web reply's token usage in its icon row. A colored bar and percentage legend compare uncached input, cache reads, and output; hover shows exact counts and cache hit rate. It needs the host slot and session data, but no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:278-324","client.js:41-57","client.js:164-171"]}
