{"unit_id":"LobotomyCorporation__dsh-token-bar#caveat-1","repo":"LobotomyCorporation/dsh-token-bar","commit":"2fbb659a9f833fd191ff7a71e0e4b9aab929e109","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-bar 使用前须知：仅在轮次完成且有统计时显示；为查看较早回复的用量条，助手图标行会保持可见。见 client.js:278-293, client.js:90-99","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:278-293","client.js:90-99"]}
